      "displayDate": "Jan 26, 1977 • 9:30 AM",
      "content": "The procedure is simple: we cleanse the child's teeth and then apply the fluoride solution directly. It's supervised by the Michigan Department of Public Health.",
      "person_id": "p_dental_staff",
      "sourcePdf": "temp/North%20Kent%20Leader%20-%2001-26-1977%20-%20Page%206-1.jpg"
