      "displayDate": "Jan 26, 1977 • 10:15 AM",
      "content": "Studies show this technique can reduce tooth decay by 40% to 65% when compared with fluoridated water alone. Decidedly worth the four-visit program!",
      "person_id": "p_health_official",
      "sourcePdf": "temp/North%20Kent%20Leader%20-%2001-26-1977%20-%20Page%206-1.jpg"
